SUMMARY:Teen Tumble
DESCRIPTION:Older kids love to tumble too! This class is for tweens and teens who will enjoy increasing their strength\, flexibility and fitness while learning new tricks–perfect for anyone who wants to level-up their tumbling skills for dance teams\, cheer leading\, or just for fun! Beginning through intermediate levels are welcome. Our studio is not appropriate for advanced tumbling. We will shape the class based on the needs and interests of the students. This is a five-week session\, or drop-in to a single class and pay at the door! \nEditor’s note: This event is a community submission.
URL:https://pdxparent.com/event-single/teen-tumble-2/2026-05-05/
LOCATION:Sellwood Community House\, 1436 SE Spokane St\, Portland\, Oregon\, 97202
CATEGORIES:Active,Kids Calendar,Sports
